Deals [178, 240, 287, 328, 364 (TL1-5; SP 100; PARADOX 300)] temporal damage over 4 turns to all targets in a radius of [1, 1, 1, 1, 2 (TL1-5; PARADOX 300)].  Targets with Reality Smearing active will instead recover [71, 95, 114, 131, 145 (TL1-5; SP 100; PARADOX 300)] life over four turns.

If a target is reduced below 20% life while Attenuate is active it may be instantly slain.

The damage will scale with your Spellpower.
